  dialogues:
  - name: Intro
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 15e8f73995edd064b890c697af25a3ce, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - "It\u2019s the year 2226."
    - The world has grown cold and dark.
    - The ancient megacity Neokalmar is a husk of its former glory.
    - Scavengers search through the city for anything to help their little societies
      survive.
    - Dangers lurk everywhere.
    - From the deadly cold outside the city.
    - To the biomechanical monstrosities within.
    - Those travelling through the city must be careful.
    - Their next expedition might be their last.
  - name: Tutorial
    portrait: {fileID: -583743315, guid: 9eb1f13c449026d43b777a12a3cc6f75, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - Left-click on the ground to move.
